@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = <pega_tu_token_aqui>
@podcastId = <pega_un_id_de_podcast_aqui>

### ============================================================
### AUTH
### ============================================================

### Registrar usuario normal
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "MiPassword123"
}

###

### Registrar usuario admin (cambia el rol desde MongoDB si es necesario)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "AdminPass123"
}

###

### Login — copia el token de la respuesta y pégalo en @token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "MiPassword123"
}

###

### Login admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "AdminPass123"
}

###

### Obtener perfil del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================
### PODCASTS — rutas públicas
### ============================================================

### Listar podcasts publicados (sin auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/podcasts

###

### Obtener podcast por ID (sin auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/podcasts/{{podcastId}}

###

### ============================================================
### PODCASTS — rutas autenticadas
### ============================================================

### Crear podcast
POST {{baseUrl}}/podcasts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tech Talk Weekly",
  "description": "Un podcast semanal sobre tecnología y desarrollo",
  "category": "tech",
  "duration": 3600,
  "episodes": 1
}

###

### Actualizar podcast (solo el autor)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/podcasts/{{podcastId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tech Talk Weekly - Actualizado",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada del podcast",
  "duration": 4200
}

###

### ============================================================
### PODCASTS — rutas admin
### ============================================================

### Listar todos los podcasts incluidos no publicados (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/podcasts/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Publicar / despublicar un podcast (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/podcasts/{{podcastId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Eliminar un podcast (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/podcasts/{{podcastId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
